  "details": "Hey, everyone, it's Daniil_KnyaZz.\n\nI have another suggestion which will be a good implementation for VRChat.\n\nMy suggestion is having another category in the world selection just for your friends.\n\nAddition - Explanation\n\n<<I feel this would be a good idea because it will allow you to access friends maps a lot easier and to check out there latest works without having to click on there profile and having to see what maps they created one at a time.\n\nAnother reason is it will categorise the maps from latest to oldest showing which friends have recently created a map and which people haven't updated there's yet.\n\nFinally another valid reason as to why people should have this implemented into the game is it might also help save time finding a specific map your friend has created without having to figure out which friend created it and also when they uploaded it.>>\n\nAlso here is how i see this idea.\n\nWhen its Expand and Collapse.",
